      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes, I'd personally like it to be more transparent, but I've seen people that would instead like it to be more opaque. Being able to tweak the opacity would be good. Location wise, the mod implementation where it was in the bottom left rather than the center bottom is preferrable to me, as it was less in the way and less noticeable than now. The current face mirror also appears to be slightly stretched?",
